{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer\u00a0</strong>Invite-only \u2013 no public matchmaking or server browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must host or join via friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949880/extras/09a27856fe4570b24d4018ae29289983.avif?t=1760114234\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Impulse</i> is a chaotic, physics-based party game where up to 4 players push, shove, race, and outmaneuver each other across a variety of ridiculous mini-games. Whether you\u2019re knocking friends off a platform, scrambling up moving obstacles, or surviving a collapsing arena, one thing is certain \u2014 someone\u2019s going to get launched into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with Friends, master your momentum, and use perfectly-timed pushes to claim victory. Every match is quick, unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949880/extras/6347295210dbb25d489c22362f971f46.avif?t=1760114234\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Party Mayhem</strong> \u2013  play where friends battle, race, and knock each other around in chaotic arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong> \u2013 Compete in Knock-Out, Get-to-the-Top, The Box, and more, each offering unique challenges and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Physics Combat</strong> \u2013 Push, bump, and launch your opponents with unpredictable ragdoll physics and over-the-top momentum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Arenas</strong> \u2013 Colorful, varied stages with hazards, moving platforms, and environmental surprises that keep every match fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Rounds &amp; Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 Short, high-energy matches that make \u201cjust one more game\u201d turn into hours of laughter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible but Competitive</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up controls for casual players, with room for skillful timing and strategy for competitive fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hilarious Chaos</strong> \u2013 Exaggerated animations, goofy knockbacks, and unpredictable outcomes make every round entertaining to watch and play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Parties or Streams</strong> \u2013 Designed for maximum laughs whether you\u2019re on the couch with friends or showing off online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949880/extras/fbc44810412bdd4fe034787538c2610c.avif?t=1760114234\" data-has-big width=1560 height=504 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here to win or just to cause trouble, <i>Impulse</i> is all about fun, momentum, and the thrill of sending your friends flying.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949880?t=1760114234","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949880?t=1760114234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949880/98c3e7a7956edb89c1bced115180c52a55376819/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760114234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949880/98c3e7a7956edb89c1bced115180c5